#!/usr/bin/python3 -I
"""Root-owned supervisor for every unattended Codex child on macOS.

This source is installed byte-for-byte at /usr/local/libexec/qofi-codex-runner.
It is the sole sudo target: the operator never receives sudo-as-user, pkill, or
launchctl authority. The installed file and immutable Node/Codex entrypoint are
bound by SHA-256 in /private/etc/qofi-codex-runtime.json.
"""

